<spell-notebook "counter notebook">
	# A counter
	A button that counts its clicks.

	## Try it
	<example "one counter">
		<counter/>
	</example>

	## Two of them
	Each counts on its own:
	<section>
		<example "two counters">
			<counter/>
			<counter/>
		</example>
		<text color="grey">Click either one.</text>
	</section>
</spell-notebook>
